      "html": "\n  <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"bar\"></span>Canais &amp; investimento — evolução</div>\n  <p class=\"sub\">SITE, GOOGLE e NÃO INFORMADO = <b>Google Ads</b> (busca). Instagram = <b>Meta Ads</b>. Indicação é orgânica (sem investimento).</p>\n  <div class=\"grid2\">\n    <div class=\"chart-box\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><span class=\"bar\"></span>Leads por canal por mês</div><div class=\"chart-container\"><canvas id=\"chanLeadChart\"></canvas></div></div>\n    <div class=\"chart-box\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><span class=\"bar\"></span>Investimento por canal × CPL pago</div><div class=\"chart-container\"><canvas id=\"chanInvChart\"></canvas></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"bar\"></span>Detalhamento por canal e mês</div>\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n    <thead><tr><th>Mês</th><th>Canal</th><th>Invest.</th><th>Leads</th><th>Conv.</th><th>Novos pac.</th><th>Receita</th><th>CPL</th><th>Taxa conv.</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody><tr><td>Julho</td><td><span class=\"chan c-google\">Google Ads</span></td><td>R$ 607,96</td><td>40</td><td>14</td><td>6</td><td>R$ 1.400</td><td>R$ 15,20</td><td>35,0%</td></tr><tr><td>Julho</td><td><span class=\"chan c-meta\">Meta Ads</span></td><td>R$ 648,08</td><td>6</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>R$ 0</td><td>R$ 108,01</td><td>33,3%</td></tr><tr><td>Julho</td><td><span class=\"chan c-ind\">Indicação</span></td><td>—</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>3</td><td>R$ 11.600</td><td>—</td><td>100,0%</td></tr><tr><td>Agosto</td><td><span class=\"chan c-google\">Google Ads</span></td><td>R$ 1.010,11</td><td>31</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>R$ 0</td><td>R$ 32,58</td><td>16,1%</td></tr><tr><td>Agosto</td><td><span class=\"chan c-meta\">Meta Ads</span></td><td>R$ 980,68</td><td>6</td><td>3</td><td>0</td><td>R$ 0</td><td>R$ 163,45</td><td>50,0%</td></tr><tr><td>Agosto</td><td><span class=\"chan c-